{"id":"fc8adc48040f8a4b","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-fubini-theorem.md","title":"Fubini's Theorem","display":"df-fubini-theorem — Fubini's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-fubini-theorem","aliases":["58-df-fubini-theorem","58-df-fubini","Fubini"],"display":"df-fubini-theorem — Fubini's Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-fubini-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-fubini-theorem</span><span>58-df-fubini</span><span>Fubini</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-fubini-theorem — Fubini's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a8bb827e3e31f34f\" href=\"?note=a8bb827e3e31f34f\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ad78f775172312be\" href=\"?note=ad78f775172312be\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md\">../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,\\Sigma,\\rho,f,s_X,s_Y\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,\\Sigma,\\rho,f,s_X,s_Y\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the predicates from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FubiniProductDatum}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FubiniProductDatum}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SectionFamilies}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{SectionFamilies}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> are defined below.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}product\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FubiniProductDatum}_S(\\Sigma,\\rho,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal G,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\rho,X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall C\\in\\mathcal G\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(B\\times C)=\\mu(B)\\nu(C)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}product\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FubiniProductDatum}_S(\\Sigma,\\rho,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal G,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\rho,X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall C\\in\\mathcal G\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(B\\times C)=\\mu(B)\\nu(C)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}sections}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SectionFamilies}_S(s_X,s_Y,f,X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(s_X,X,\\mathbb R^Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s_Y,Y,\\mathbb R^X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\n\\bigl(s_X(x)(y)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\n\\land s_Y(y)(x)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}sections}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SectionFamilies}_S(s_X,s_Y,f,X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Function}(s_X,X,\\mathbb R^Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s_Y,Y,\\mathbb R^X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\n\\bigl(s_X(x)(y)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\n\\land s_Y(y)(x)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FubiniProductDatum}_S(\\Sigma,\\rho,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{SectionFamilies}_S(s_X,s_Y,f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}|f|\\,d\\rho&lt;\\infty\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists N_X\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists N_Y\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(N_X)=0\\land\\nu(N_Y)=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N_X\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(s_X(x);Y,\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\int_Y|s_X(x)|\\,d\\nu&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\setminus N_Y\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(s_Y(y);X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\int_X|s_Y(y)|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}f\\,d\\rho\n=\\int_X\\left(\\int_Ys_X(x)(y)\\,d\\nu(y)\\right)d\\mu(x)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}f\\,d\\rho\n=\\int_Y\\left(\\int_Xs_Y(y)(x)\\,d\\mu(x)\\right)d\\nu(y)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FubiniProductDatum}_S(\\Sigma,\\rho,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{SectionFamilies}_S(s_X,s_Y,f,X,Y)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}|f|\\,d\\rho&lt;\\infty\\\\\n\\to{}&amp;\n\\exists N_X\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists N_Y\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(N_X)=0\\land\\nu(N_Y)=0\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N_X\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(s_X(x);Y,\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\int_Y|s_X(x)|\\,d\\nu&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\setminus N_Y\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(s_Y(y);X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\int_X|s_Y(y)|\\,d\\mu&lt;\\infty\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}f\\,d\\rho\n=\\int_X\\left(\\int_Ys_X(x)(y)\\,d\\nu(y)\\right)d\\mu(x)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}f\\,d\\rho\n=\\int_Y\\left(\\int_Xs_Y(y)(x)\\,d\\mu(x)\\right)d\\nu(y)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The product sigma algebra and the particular product measure used by all three integrals are explicit data.</li>\n<li>Section functions are set-coded through <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_X\">\\(s_X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_Y\">\\(s_Y\\)</span>; almost-everywhere section integrability is expressed by explicit null sets.</li>\n<li>Tonelli's theorem treats nonnegative measurable functions and permits the value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+\\infty\">\\(+\\infty\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Folland, Real Analysis</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a8bb827e3e31f34f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-measure3-product-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ad78f775172312be","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure3-sigma-finite-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-measurable-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu,\\Sigma,\\rho,f,s_X,s_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FubiniProductDatum}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SectionFamilies}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}product\\text{-}datum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FubiniProductDatum}_S(\\Sigma,\\rho,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3ProductSigmaAlgebra}_S(X,\\mathcal F,Y,\\mathcal G,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\nu,Y,\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\rho,X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\forall C\\in\\mathcal G\\;\n\\bigl(\\rho(B\\times C)=\\mu(B)\\nu(C)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}sections}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SectionFamilies}_S(s_X,s_Y,f,X,Y)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Function}(s_X,X,\\mathbb R^Y)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(s_Y,Y,\\mathbb R^X)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\forall y\\in Y\\;\n\\bigl(s_X(x)(y)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\n\\land s_Y(y)(x)=f(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fubini\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{FubiniProductDatum}_S(\\Sigma,\\rho,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure3SigmaFiniteMeasure}_S(Y,\\mathcal G,\\nu)\n\\land\\mathrm{SectionFamilies}_S(s_X,s_Y,f,X,Y)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(f;X\\times Y,\\Sigma)\n\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}|f|\\,d\\rho<\\infty\\\\\n\\to{}&\n\\exists N_X\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists N_Y\\in\\mathcal G\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(N_X)=0\\land\\nu(N_Y)=0\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall x\\in X\\setminus N_X\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(s_X(x);Y,\\mathcal G)\n\\land\\int_Y|s_X(x)|\\,d\\nu<\\infty\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall y\\in Y\\setminus N_Y\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{BorelMeasurable}_S(s_Y(y);X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\int_X|s_Y(y)|\\,d\\mu<\\infty\\bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}f\\,d\\rho\n=\\int_X\\left(\\int_Ys_X(x)(y)\\,d\\nu(y)\\right)d\\mu(x)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\int_{X\\times Y}f\\,d\\rho\n=\\int_Y\\left(\\int_Xs_Y(y)(x)\\,d\\mu(x)\\right)d\\nu(y)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"s_X","display":false},{"tex":"s_Y","display":false},{"tex":"+\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":3169,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-558","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-fubini-theorem.md|58-df-fubini-theorem]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["ca832ed6bc22f728","a8bb827e3e31f34f","ad78f775172312be","bbbec05fde1d3b01","36d7463d215be751"]}